{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2022-02-10 10:36:00', 'title': 'THREE LMC COMMUNITIES EARN ELITE 1% ORA POWER RANKINGS', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., FEB. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LMC , A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LENNAR CORPORATION AND A LEADER IN APARTMENT DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THREE LMC COMMUNITIES WERE RECOGNIZED IN THE 2021 ELITE 1% ORA POWER RANKINGS.'}